解决方法如下：
keybindings.json 中增加类似下面的片段
``` js
[
{
"key": "ctrl+m",
"command": "editor.emmet.action.expandAbbreviation",
"when": "editorTextFocus"
}
]
```
之后输入 emmet 后按设定的快捷键就好了

